														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1322012">
									

<p>I think the slimmer, original version of the memory worked better. For one, we don't really need to know her exact age, as being thrown would easily put her in what, 3-5 age range anyway? So that information is kinda unneccessary and breaks up the mood.</p>
<p>Neither do I think you need to put down the name either. Those who spends the time on the site will get it, for the rest it will just be a kind of bittersweet moment in the Foundation.</p>
<p>Iono, this seems like the kind of thing where you don't need to much exposition. The mood is its strength.</p>
<p>Secondly, I'm kinda hoping sometime you will continue on this, either dropping hints and references in other places, or giving a few more excerps. Which means most details could be saved til' then.</p>
<p>Anyway that's my two cents.</p>

							</div>

								
					
